{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52535","headline":"语州县诸公敏续 · 陈元光","name":"语州县诸公敏续","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"总角趋朝对，雄飞出禁城。\n人才当翊国，世赏可辞荣。\n怜厥神童子，寻爲壮友生。\n南方承父镇，北阙列儒名。\n移孝爲忠吉，由奢入俭宁。\n长安瞻日月，岭海肃风霆。\n败事诚因酒，增高必自陵。\n尊老须养老，使士要推诚。\n寅协无他式，清勤慎不矜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52535.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52535","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}